<title>ESTONIA: NORMA TO RAISE PROFIT FORECAST.</title>
<headline>NORMA TO RAISE PROFIT FORECAST.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-07-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Norma said on Tuesday it will in the coming two weeks announce its new 1997 profit estimate, which will be almost two times higher, of 90-100 million kroons.</p>
<p>&quot;The new profit forecast should be about 90-100 million kroons,&quot; Norma finance director Peep Pihotalo told Reuters.  </p>
<p>Pihotalo said Norma has exceeded its previous profit forecast and the new figure will be 85-90 percent higher.</p>
<p>The company's earlier forecast was for a profit of 50.2 million kroons for the whole of the year.</p>
<p>-- Eva Palu, Tallinn newsroom, +372 6209 201, reuters@reuters.ee</p>
